{"ID":"20240504170624-5ejry60","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170624-5ejry60","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170624-5ejry60\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624105453-gwfo0ov\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611130120-4oh53o9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1908,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624105704-ahtpxo6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:14,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:14\u0026#125;","title":"158枲耳实（苍耳子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240813145358"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240724084614-1gvvkhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724084614-1gvvkhv","updated":"20240724084615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山东、江西、湖北、江苏等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈纺锤形或卵圆形，表面黄棕色或黄绿色、全体有钩刺，顶端有2枚较粗的刺，分离或相连，基部有果梗痕。质硬而韧，横切面 中央有纵隔膜，2室，各有l枚瘦果。瘦果略呈纺锤形，一面较平坦，顶端其1突起的花柱基，果皮薄，灰黑色，具纵纹。种皮膜质，浅灰色，子叶2，有油性。气微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温。\n【功效】\t散风寒，通鼻窍，祛风湿。用于风寒头痛，鼻塞流涕，鼻鼽，鼻渊，风疹瘙痒，湿痹拘挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240724084658-imfue5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724084658-imfue5c","updated":"20240724084658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094321-0l076j8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724084704-6z6ez0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724084704-6z6ez0z","updated":"20240813141522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苍耳子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苍耳子-20240205154857-u7wz00a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813141623-jnha9qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813141623-jnha9qo","updated":"20240813141623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苍耳子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苍耳子-20240813141623-jzq82vc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813141713-dffbee0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813141713-dffbee0","updated":"20240813141713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 662px;","style":"width: 652px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苍耳子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苍耳子 1-20240813141713-ptwow7k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 652px;\" parent-style=\"width: 662px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813141847-5w5fwpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813141847-5w5fwpa","updated":"20240813142032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 451px;","style":"width: 441px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苍耳子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苍耳子 2-20240813141847-y34q44o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 441px;\" parent-style=\"width: 451px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 341px;","style":"width: 331px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkT